       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CODEGEN-INSPECT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 WS-TEXT PIC X(6).
       77 WS-COUNT PIC 9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "AAABAA" TO WS-TEXT.
           MOVE 2 TO WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR LEADING "A".
           DISPLAY "LEADING=" WS-COUNT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT
               FOR CHARACTERS AFTER INITIAL "Z".
           DISPLAY "AFTER-MISSING=" WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING FIRST "AA" BY "XY".
           DISPLAY "FIRST=" WS-TEXT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING LEADING "X" BY "Z".
           DISPLAY "REPLACE-LEADING=" WS-TEXT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT CONVERTING "AZY" TO "123".
           DISPLAY "CONVERT=" WS-TEXT.
           STOP RUN.
